<title>CHINA: China Handan Steel sees profit at 702 mln yuan.</title>
<headline>China Handan Steel sees profit at 702 mln yuan.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Handan Steel and Iron Group Co Ltd saw sales reach 5.15 billion yuan ($620 million) at end-1996 while pre-tax profit was 702 million yuan, the Financial News said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its output value per capita was 102,800 yuan and profit per capita 24,600 yuan, ranking it second in China's domestic steel industry at end-1996, it said.</p>
<p>Its ratio of assets to liabilities was reduced by 0.3 percent compared with the year-ago period and stood at 39.22 percent compared with 70 percent in 1990, it said.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>($1.0 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
